WEBVTT

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.170
Here we go~

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.530
Yes!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:47.760
My name is Kinomoto Sakura

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.330
I'm in the 4th grade of Tomoida elementary school

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.600
My favorite subjects are Taiku and Music

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.710
My least favorite subject is Math

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.810
For now, I'm a girl who's full of energy!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.600
I'm a girl who's full of energy!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.460
What are you doing in your room?

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:09.150
If that's the case, it was really noisy.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.920
It's normal!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.110
Just by you walking,

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.860
I can hear the sound of a monster walking around.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:24.240
My name is Touya Onii-chan.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.800
I'm in the second year of high school.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.830
I go to Seijou High School right next to my elementary school.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.300
You're always mean, aren't you?

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.100
You're super tall, you know?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.700
How annoying!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:38.460
Someday, you'll be as big as a lantern.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.370
You're definitely going to be fat!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:45.150
I'm going to drink!

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.280
You've been friends since the morning, huh?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.060
This is my father, Fujitaka-san.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.060
He's a professor at a university,

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.820
and he's very kind and good at cooking and sewing.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:58.030
Here you go.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.090
Wow, it's so good!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.820
This is my family.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.820
Huh? Mom?

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:09.090
My mom passed away when I was 3 years old.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.880
But I'm not lonely.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.280
I have a father.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.260
I'm mean, but I have an older brother.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.200
Is it good?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.590
Thank you for the food.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.090
I'll take you to the soccer club.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.050
Have a nice day.

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:24.830
I'm off.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.560
Hey!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:37.930
Are you done with your lunch?

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:46.290
I went ahead of you.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.630
Do you want to go clubbing today?

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.680
Have a nice day!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.940
You'll be fine even if you go out a little late.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.840
We're going to school together.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:26.880
Yugi!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:37.400
Yo!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.680
Good morning, Touya.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:41.190
Good morning, Sakura-chan.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.730
You woke up early.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.090
I had breakfast in five minutes.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:57.040
Sakura-chan, you're doing well today, aren't you?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.000
This is Yukito Tsukishiro.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.760
He's in the same class as my brother, he's in the second year of high school.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.740
I can't believe that he's my brother's friend.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.730
He's a kind and wonderful person.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:14.810
See you, Sakura-chan.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:21.090
Ah, I'm already here.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:29.960
See you.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:56.760
Besides, the gift is my best friend.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:07:00.000
She is a good person, beautiful, and has a big company.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.280
I'm the owner's daughter.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.640
Akino Sakura-chan, you're so cute.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.700
What?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:10.700
You're holding a candy and taking a picture.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.160
Um, Tomoyo-chan.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.080
You wanted to take a video or a picture, right?

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.750
Are you listening?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.750
Tomoyo-chan likes to take videos and pictures.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.090
She takes a lot of pictures of me, too.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.020
That's right.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.870
I bought a new video camera.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.000
Please let me take it again.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.480
But don't you think it's better to take something more interesting than me?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:49.450
Ahaha, that's a cute thing!

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:55.760
Then I can see the boy's face with his mouth wide open.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.030
You must have been surprised.

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.920
Do you think it's a magical orange?

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.960
Huh? Is that me?

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.000
It's a picture that looks like me.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.170
What is it?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.210
Oh, it's today.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:13.430
Minamoto-san, read it.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.160
It's later.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.080
It's from the 12th line.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.510
Do you think it's a magical orange?

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:23.120
After all, it's a butterfly.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:23.840
Eh?

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:33.300
Thank you, Kinomoto-san.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.890
Next, we'll be practicing Tosu.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.660
Everyone, please prepare your batons.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:48.180
I'm really curious about that dream.

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:52.150
I'll talk to Tomoyo-chan about it next time.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.990
Kira-chan is very athletic and good at batting.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:13.380
But sometimes she does that.

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.930
It will be 9 o'clock.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:34.870
That's fast.

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.690
Dad, you're late.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:47.670
Are you going home?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.720
It's from this library.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.350
Let's take a look.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:25.600
Let's take a close look at the thief.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.360
If there's anyone, let's call the police.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.280
No one's here.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:05.890
What is this?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.670
It's been a long time since I've seen this book in Osaka.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.290
I'm completely out of the Osaka dialect.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:38.620
So, what are you doing?

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.240
Where are you coming from?

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:43.230
You're a toy!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:47.350
I am the seal beast that protects this book, Kerberos!

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:48.290
Seal?

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.030
Kerberos?

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:51.020
That's right.

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:56.120
It's mine to watch over the cards in this book so that they don't do anything wrong.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:24.450
When I read "Windy," the wind suddenly came up, and everything flew away!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:36.860
I-I-I can't do this!

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.840
Where are you taking it?

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:52.150
I don't know where the card is.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.960
Here.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.380
It looks heavy.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:59.670
There's a crow card in this book.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.620
Crow card?

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:03.350
Crow card.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:05.330
When that seal is broken,

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:09.070
disaster will come to this world.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:14.600
That card is a special card made by a great magician called Crow Reed.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.640
Each and every one of them is alive, and has great power.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.440
Each of them is willing to act as they please,

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.600
and they can't stand against the waves.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:27.470
That's why Crow himself made this book,

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.000
and put the seal on the cover of the book.

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.190
Anyway, we have to bring back the card.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:39.330
Then, I'll ask you to come with me.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.890
Why me?

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:45.310
You're the one who used the wind spell to break the card.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:50.990
But you have to seal this card properly, right?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.670
Well, I just fell asleep.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:54.600
How long?

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.720
About 30 years.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.000
Are you still a seal beast?

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:06.290
That sound must have been a snore, right?

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.170
This book is a used one.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.560
It has a bit of magic, you know!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:13.450
What's your name?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.450
Sakura.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.120
Alright, Sakura. Stand over there.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:23.410
Eh? Eh?

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:28.280
The key to the seal.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:30.000
The one who wishes to make a contract with Nanji...

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:37.110
Give power to the girl who is going to be named Sakuma!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:19.200
The capture of the flow card. Isn't that cool?

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:23.610
I'm a normal person. Even if I'm told about the calamity of this world...

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:27.630
Who was the one who stabbed me and broke my cards?

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:30.000
Don't even try to ban the cards, you're just a cat.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.090
Who was the one who stood in my way?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:38.090
I have a severe cold!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:49.650
It's a flow card!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:53.110
Oh, it's a fly card.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:55.090
Are you crazy?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.460
What are you talking about?

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.160
It's the first job of the cardcaptor, Sakura!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:17:59.760
What?

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.870
I will show it to you in front of me.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.880
Under the contract, Sakura commands...

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.540
I should be able to catch it with the current Windy's card!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.940
Is that true?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:21.410
Anyway, if I don't get a little closer...

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.770
It's a card from the library!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:48.970
Stupid! I'm here again!

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:50.160
I'll do something about this!

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:39.740
It's better to have a lot of experience in order to become a good adult.

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.370
It's a card that I managed to catch.

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:42.880
I'll try it right away.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.860
What can I do with this?

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.580
Well, give it a try.

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:02.070
What do you think? Doesn't it feel good?

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:04.540
Yeah!

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:07.620
I'll be in your care from now on, Cardcaptor Sakura.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:11.940
What's that?

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:35.280
That's all

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:41.510
My name is Kerberos, and you're watching "Shikai Shinkou".

00:23:41.510 --> 00:23:50.100
I'm a fan of Sakura, and I'm going to explain a lot of things that come out of the card cap.

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:51.360
Ta-da!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:56.350
It's a uniform designated by Omoeda Elementary School.

00:23:56.350 --> 00:24:00.000
There are two types of this uniform, a short sleeve and a long sleeve.

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:05.830
This one has a long sleeve, and it has a chic design with an elegant feeling.

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:09.080
The point is the light brown on the left sleeve.

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:11.900
It also has a cute hat, so it's more and more good.

00:24:11.900 --> 00:24:15.430
And, Kero-chan!

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.970
This time, the check point is the skirt.

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:21.210
The white skirt is quite similar to Sakura, isn't it?

00:24:21.210 --> 00:24:24.000
By the way, this is for men.

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:26.930
So, this is the end for this time.

00:24:26.930 --> 00:24:30.000
What do you think? I was weak, right?

00:24:30.060 --> 00:24:32.060
Everyone, please look forward to it!

00:24:32.060 --> 00:24:33.890
See ya!

00:24:33.890 --> 00:24:44.440
I sealed Fly's card, but it's impossible for me to use Card Captor!

00:24:44.440 --> 00:24:48.360
If my friend finds out about this, it'll be a big problem!

00:24:48.360 --> 00:24:53.210
Besides, I wonder what video Tomoya-chan wants to show me.

00:24:53.210 --> 00:24:56.990
Card Captor Sakura, what a great friend!

00:24:56.990 --> 00:24:59.820
Next time, we'll be training with Sakura!

00:27:35.980 --> 00:27:37.280
It's Kerberos!

00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:39.160
That's right...

00:27:39.160 --> 00:27:41.710
In the book I found in my basement,

00:27:41.710 --> 00:27:43.030
there was a "Claw Card"...

00:27:43.030 --> 00:27:45.030
I don't know what it is,

00:27:45.030 --> 00:27:47.030
but it had a magic card in it,

00:27:47.030 --> 00:27:48.980
and I broke it,

00:27:48.980 --> 00:27:50.980
so I was asked by Kerberos-san

00:27:50.980 --> 00:27:52.980
to collect the cards.

00:27:52.980 --> 00:27:58.060
After Sakura!

00:27:58.060 --> 00:27:59.960
Here's your card, Captain!

00:28:00.090 --> 00:28:01.590
I can't do it!

00:28:01.590 --> 00:28:11.500
I got the card back, though.

00:28:12.790 --> 00:28:13.780
See? See?

00:28:13.780 --> 00:28:15.660
I was so mean.

00:28:16.500 --> 00:28:18.000
Breakfast time!

00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:30.000
I just called her once and she came down.

00:28:31.210 --> 00:28:34.310
Is it going to rain today?

00:28:34.310 --> 00:28:36.050
Hmm?

00:28:36.050 --> 00:28:40.600
Hehe...

00:28:40.600 --> 00:28:42.710
Hmm...

00:28:42.710 --> 00:28:47.550
Mom?

00:28:47.550 --> 00:28:49.760
Good morning!

00:28:49.760 --> 00:28:50.790
Good...

00:28:50.790 --> 00:28:52.020
Good morning!

00:28:52.020 --> 00:28:55.040
You look delicious today, too.

00:28:55.040 --> 00:28:58.070
It's a monster night.

00:29:14.520 --> 00:29:30.000
You're really fast today.

00:29:50.250 --> 00:29:52.370
Your kids are busy, aren't they?

00:29:52.370 --> 00:29:57.880
Your brother and father are in school, so you can turn on the TV in your room in a little while.

00:29:57.880 --> 00:30:00.000
You're still a student, aren't you?

00:30:00.220 --> 00:30:01.800
I'm a professor at the university!

00:30:01.800 --> 00:30:05.980
You can't leave the room while my people are here.

00:30:05.980 --> 00:30:07.890
Everyone will be surprised.

00:30:07.890 --> 00:30:08.740
Okay.

00:31:05.950 --> 00:31:07.900
Do you want to decorate the classroom?

00:31:07.900 --> 00:31:13.940
Yes.

00:31:13.940 --> 00:31:18.530
Be careful.

00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:09.410
Look! I got something very interesting last night!

00:33:00.350 --> 00:33:02.710
Ah, I was so happy.

00:33:02.710 --> 00:33:04.640
Why did you follow me?

00:33:04.640 --> 00:33:09.980
Well, I wanted to take a look at the daily life of a cardcaptor.

00:33:09.980 --> 00:33:14.250
If you don't mind, would you like to introduce yourself?

00:33:14.250 --> 00:33:17.960
I heard your name is Kerberos.

00:33:17.960 --> 00:33:20.960
Oh, it's a different impression from your name.

00:33:20.960 --> 00:33:22.950
It feels like Kero-chan.

00:33:22.950 --> 00:33:27.120
Really?

00:33:27.120 --> 00:33:29.700
The seal beast that protects the black card, Kerberos!

00:34:00.320 --> 00:34:02.100
No, I can do it!

00:34:02.100 --> 00:34:04.160
If you want, I can do it!

00:34:30.380 --> 00:34:32.600
Show me your golden form.

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:35.410
Under the contract, Sakura will command you.

00:35:02.080 --> 00:35:03.590
The spell is from the magical girl!

00:36:22.750 --> 00:36:25.250
I wonder if I have to clean it up...

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:32.400
Good morning, Tomoyo-chan.

00:36:32.400 --> 00:36:34.290
Good morning.

00:36:34.290 --> 00:36:36.600
It's a great situation, isn't it?

00:36:36.600 --> 00:36:39.510
To be able to do something like this...

00:36:39.510 --> 00:36:43.350
Maybe this is also the work of the crow-card?

00:36:43.350 --> 00:36:44.600
Huh?

00:36:44.600 --> 00:36:50.070
It's the work of the crow-card!

00:36:50.070 --> 00:36:53.280
I'm going to save you!

00:36:53.280 --> 00:36:58.390
Thanks to that, the class is over.

00:36:58.390 --> 00:37:00.000
I-I was happy about that, but...

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:04.250
But what's a crow card that messes up the school?

00:37:04.250 --> 00:37:06.670
I don't know.

00:37:06.670 --> 00:37:11.030
Anyway, Sakura! It's the turn of the card captor!

00:37:11.030 --> 00:37:12.210
Why?

00:37:12.210 --> 00:37:15.470
If it's a crow card, you have to catch it, right?

00:37:15.470 --> 00:37:17.710
That's why it's impossible.

00:37:17.710 --> 00:37:21.270
Who blew the card away?

00:37:21.270 --> 00:37:24.850
Then let's go to school right away!

00:37:24.850 --> 00:37:27.450
Good evening?

00:37:27.450 --> 00:37:29.090
Good evening?

00:37:44.300 --> 00:37:47.410
There's a school in the city.

00:38:00.480 --> 00:38:02.140
It's because it's my hobby!

00:38:04.450 --> 00:38:06.840
Tonight, the three of us will attack!

00:38:06.840 --> 00:38:10.850
Once it's decided, we must hurry up and complete the final pose!

00:38:10.850 --> 00:38:13.090
Oh! I'm going to do my special training now!

00:38:13.090 --> 00:38:27.720
It's okay, I'm with you.

00:38:29.100 --> 00:38:30.000
It's okay, right?

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:31.090
I don't think so.

00:38:31.090 --> 00:38:44.560
Yeah?

00:39:05.850 --> 00:39:07.500
My lady, then...

00:39:07.500 --> 00:39:10.560
Yes, please come visit me when you contact me.

00:39:10.560 --> 00:39:17.050
Amazing!

00:39:17.050 --> 00:39:21.050
There aren't many elementary school students with a bodyguard.

00:39:21.050 --> 00:39:24.580
It's a magic lesson.

00:39:24.580 --> 00:39:25.730
Maybe...

00:39:25.730 --> 00:39:27.200
More importantly...

00:40:00.280 --> 00:40:06.020
If you don't wear a suit that suits the character, you might lose your spirit to the card.

00:40:06.020 --> 00:40:09.660
I'm glad you know that.

00:40:09.660 --> 00:40:11.190
Change your clothes, Sakura.

00:40:11.190 --> 00:40:12.640
I have a hat, too.

00:40:12.640 --> 00:40:30.000
Get inside, Sakura-chan.

00:40:31.560 --> 00:40:32.240
I'm scared.

00:41:00.760 --> 00:41:02.300
What was that sound?

00:41:02.300 --> 00:41:08.480
What did it say?

00:41:08.480 --> 00:41:14.440
It's the guard's signal.

00:43:11.480 --> 00:43:16.880
It seems that Shadow's card has collected all the keys of the students at this school.

00:43:16.880 --> 00:43:20.380
It's impossible for Sakura to deal with this number of people.

00:43:20.380 --> 00:43:23.170
Is there any way?

00:43:23.170 --> 00:43:26.220
The key of the student disappears if you hit the light.

00:43:26.220 --> 00:43:28.530
All that's left is Shadow's body, Sakai.

00:43:28.530 --> 00:43:30.000
If you tie it with magic,

00:43:30.120 --> 00:43:32.760
but it's late at night now, you know?

00:43:32.760 --> 00:43:34.360
If that's the case,

00:43:34.360 --> 00:43:36.120
please leave it to me!

00:43:36.120 --> 00:43:37.170
Eh?

00:44:34.890 --> 00:44:36.420
The light has disappeared!

00:44:36.420 --> 00:44:39.420
Other than the main body, if you use all the light, it will disappear!

00:44:39.420 --> 00:44:44.980
It's impossible to call Toto-san, but I can turn on the lights myself!

00:44:44.980 --> 00:44:47.800
Thank you, Tomoyo-chan!

00:47:38.410 --> 00:47:39.160
Let's go.

00:48:45.070 --> 00:48:49.010
It's time to leave this corner to you, Kero-chan.

00:48:49.010 --> 00:48:51.960
Come on, let's cheer up and go this week!

00:48:51.960 --> 00:48:55.620
The first battle costume to appear from today.

00:48:55.620 --> 00:48:59.120
This is made by a friend of Sakura's, Tomoyo.

00:49:01.240 --> 00:49:04.020
It's fun to make cakes and such.

00:49:04.020 --> 00:49:11.010
Also, it's my hobby to put on the costume I designed and shoot it with a video camera.

00:49:11.010 --> 00:49:14.510
Even so, Tomoe has a good sense of humor.

00:49:14.510 --> 00:49:16.390
Highly popular, Kero-chan!

00:49:16.390 --> 00:49:19.620
First, the hat.

00:49:19.620 --> 00:49:22.440
The hairpin at the end of the belt is pretty good, isn't it?

00:49:22.440 --> 00:49:26.280
And the big ribbon around the chest is the point, isn't it?

00:49:26.280 --> 00:49:30.000
Oh, it's time to wrap up. How was it?

00:49:30.510 --> 00:49:33.510
Did Sakura's costume get burned in your eyes?

00:49:33.510 --> 00:49:36.510
Sakura World is still a long way to go!

00:49:36.510 --> 00:49:37.690
See?

00:49:37.690 --> 00:49:46.890
I'm going to go with Yukito-san!

00:49:46.890 --> 00:49:48.160
But...

00:49:48.160 --> 00:49:50.050
The crow card suddenly appeared...

00:49:50.050 --> 00:49:51.050
It's terrible!

00:49:51.050 --> 00:49:55.120
I won't allow you to get in the way of my date with Yukito-san!

00:49:55.120 --> 00:49:59.000
Sakura!

00:49:59.000 --> 00:50:00.000
Sakura's heart-throbbing first appearance!

00:50:01.050 --> 00:50:04.130
Next time, with Sakura, ready~

00:51:53.230 --> 00:51:54.770
I'm in the 4th grade of high school.

00:51:54.770 --> 00:51:57.540
Today is the day of socialization.

00:51:57.540 --> 00:52:00.000
I'm going to go to various public facilities

00:52:00.350 --> 00:52:02.180
We're at the aquarium!

00:52:02.180 --> 00:52:04.200
I love aquariums!

00:52:04.200 --> 00:52:07.110
The penguin show is about to begin!

00:52:07.110 --> 00:52:09.110
Let's go, Aya!

00:52:09.110 --> 00:52:11.720
Let's go, Aya!

00:53:00.120 --> 00:53:00.770
- Thank you.

00:54:19.320 --> 00:54:24.860
I haven't been out of Sakura's room in a long time, so I'm a little calm.

00:54:24.860 --> 00:54:26.900
I see.

00:54:26.900 --> 00:54:30.000
There's no way Sakura will drown.

00:54:30.380 --> 00:54:33.580
I don't really care about that.

00:54:33.580 --> 00:54:34.600
What are you talking about?

00:54:34.600 --> 00:54:45.860
I won't give you hotcakes anymore!

00:54:45.860 --> 00:54:49.860
But it's even more strange to say that the one who drowned is the penguin.

00:54:49.860 --> 00:54:54.800
The adults said that it was because the line of the pool was missing.

00:54:54.800 --> 00:54:58.360
But it's kind of different, isn't it?

00:54:58.360 --> 00:55:00.000
Hmm...

00:55:04.030 --> 00:55:07.910
That's not an accident, it's more...

00:55:08.520 --> 00:55:13.630
It's more like I know something.

00:55:13.630 --> 00:55:17.750
It's like when you were playing with a black card.

00:55:17.750 --> 00:55:21.480
I'm home!

00:55:33.070 --> 00:55:44.620
It's written here.

00:55:44.620 --> 00:55:59.670
"Esa-yari"

00:56:01.400 --> 00:56:02.300
It's not good.

00:56:02.300 --> 00:56:03.600
Why?

00:56:03.600 --> 00:56:04.710
No reason.

00:56:04.710 --> 00:56:19.100
What are you doing? Come on in!

00:56:19.100 --> 00:56:19.940
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:56:19.940 --> 00:56:22.850
I got a cramp and got in trouble.

00:56:22.850 --> 00:56:25.090
Hello, Sakura-chan.

00:56:30.350 --> 00:56:33.670
-Hello. -Looks delicious.

00:56:33.670 --> 00:56:39.240
-Sakura, you're good at cooking. -N-No, I'm not.

00:56:39.240 --> 00:56:46.650
-Yeah, you really aren't. -What?

00:56:46.650 --> 00:56:56.710
-W-Would you like some? -Sure. I bought it with my pocket money.

00:56:56.710 --> 00:56:59.600
I'll take it to my brother's room.

00:57:00.640 --> 00:57:27.080
Thank you.

00:57:35.790 --> 00:57:36.990
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:57:36.990 --> 00:57:38.290
You were there?

00:57:38.290 --> 00:57:43.190
Did you find out?

00:57:43.190 --> 00:57:44.750
Somehow...

00:57:44.750 --> 00:57:47.090
I thought Sakura-chan brought it for me.

00:57:47.090 --> 00:57:50.840
Aquarium...

00:57:50.840 --> 00:57:52.050
Water...

00:57:52.050 --> 00:57:53.330
Hmm...

00:58:03.320 --> 00:58:06.240
Hey, Sakura, what's wrong with you?

00:58:06.240 --> 00:58:07.140
I don't know!

00:58:31.150 --> 00:58:33.000
I thought I'd die...

00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:37.200
But this time it might be a bit dangerous...

00:58:37.200 --> 00:58:38.600
Eh?

00:58:38.600 --> 00:58:44.520
Of course, it was in the water where the super teacher's sister and the penguin drowned.

00:58:44.520 --> 00:58:45.690
Yes.

00:58:45.690 --> 00:58:50.090
Did you see Sakura drowning at that time?

00:58:50.090 --> 00:58:50.910
No.

00:58:50.910 --> 00:58:51.910
Nothing.

00:58:51.910 --> 00:58:53.890
The water was just floating.

00:58:53.890 --> 00:58:54.890
Haa...

00:58:54.890 --> 00:58:56.890
That's probably water.

00:58:56.890 --> 00:58:58.390
It's a Wotty card.

00:58:58.390 --> 00:58:59.390
I knew it!

00:58:59.390 --> 00:59:00.000
Then...

00:59:02.940 --> 00:59:14.950
I don't care what you say, I don't care if you're a water-born warty. Even if you're able to pull me out of the water, if you're torn apart, I'll finish you off.

00:59:15.440 --> 00:59:18.620
It's hard to catch things that are not shaped like water.

00:59:18.620 --> 00:59:23.640
Wotty is a very advanced magician among the black cards.

00:59:23.640 --> 00:59:29.600
The four elements of "Chi", "Water", "Fire", and "Wind" are quite difficult to use.

00:59:30.160 --> 00:59:33.380
On top of that, Wotty has a card for attacking magic, Sakai.

00:59:33.380 --> 00:59:34.930
He's really good at it.

00:59:34.930 --> 00:59:40.660
Sakura's cards are Windy, Fly, and Shadow.

00:59:40.660 --> 00:59:43.220
That's a lot of teeth.

00:59:43.220 --> 00:59:45.460
Hmm...

00:59:45.460 --> 00:59:51.000
For example, if you use Windy, who has the same code magic, it won't work on Wotty.

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:53.490
Windy is kind, after all.

00:59:53.490 --> 00:59:58.480
Shadow, Windy, Fly...

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:04.290
I only have these three cards.

01:00:30.060 --> 01:00:33.110
How can I catch the water...

01:00:33.110 --> 01:00:37.810
But I have to catch the card of "Worty" soon.

01:00:37.810 --> 01:00:41.010
You're not feeling well, Sakura-chan, are you?

01:00:41.010 --> 01:00:46.040
No, it's not like that.

01:00:46.040 --> 01:00:57.490
It seems that a big trial of promising to be on the side of justice has arrived.

01:00:57.490 --> 01:00:59.920
N-No...

01:01:03.480 --> 01:01:07.910
Well, maybe it's because of the black card.

01:01:07.910 --> 01:01:14.560
But, Kero-chan said it's still impossible...

01:01:31.310 --> 01:01:33.310
Thank you for listening to my story!

01:01:33.310 --> 01:01:35.930
Your smile is the best, Sakura-chan!

01:01:35.930 --> 01:01:37.140
Ahaha!

01:01:37.140 --> 01:01:41.170
This is for you, Sakura-chan!

01:01:41.170 --> 01:01:44.760
This is a new product made by my mother's company.

01:01:44.760 --> 01:01:47.090
This is for you, Sakura-chan!

01:01:47.090 --> 01:01:51.140
And this is for you, Kera-chan!

01:01:51.140 --> 01:01:54.290
This is a loan...

01:01:54.290 --> 01:01:55.610
Of course!

01:01:55.610 --> 01:01:58.870
I told you that I wanted you to know how it feels to use it!

01:02:00.190 --> 01:02:02.060
Thank you for worrying about me.

01:02:09.820 --> 01:02:21.690
I can't use what Sakura has.

01:02:31.280 --> 01:02:32.280
I'm so frustrated...

01:02:32.280 --> 01:02:54.000
Are you okay, Sakura-chan?

01:02:54.000 --> 01:02:56.000
It's dangerous if you look away.

01:02:56.000 --> 01:03:00.000
Well, thank you for the meal.

01:03:00.540 --> 01:03:02.100
It was delicious, the hot cake.

01:03:02.100 --> 01:03:04.120
N-No, it's not like that.

01:03:04.120 --> 01:03:05.500
You're late.

01:03:05.500 --> 01:03:06.480
Are you going back to the club?

01:03:06.480 --> 01:03:07.210
Eh?

01:03:07.210 --> 01:03:09.640
You're in the cheerleading club, aren't you?

01:03:09.640 --> 01:03:10.430
Ah, yes.

01:03:10.430 --> 01:03:12.160
I asked Touya.

01:03:12.160 --> 01:03:14.170
He said he threw a baton while he was practicing at home.

01:03:15.450 --> 01:03:17.030
Onii-chan!

01:03:17.030 --> 01:03:19.570
How could you do that to Yukito-san!

01:03:19.570 --> 01:03:21.380
As a thank you for the hot cake,

01:03:21.380 --> 01:03:23.130
don't you want to go eat something delicious this time?

01:03:23.130 --> 01:03:24.070
Eh?

01:03:24.070 --> 01:03:28.650
I found a restaurant that has a little delicious food.

01:03:28.650 --> 01:03:30.000
At one o'clock tomorrow,

01:03:30.030 --> 01:03:33.910
I'll meet you at the park.

01:04:36.270 --> 01:04:38.870
And did I come at the wrong time?

01:04:38.870 --> 01:04:41.260
No, you came 15 minutes early.

01:04:41.260 --> 01:04:44.640
Eh? Then, Yukito-san...

01:04:44.640 --> 01:04:46.880
Sakura-chan, don't keep me waiting.

01:04:46.880 --> 01:04:55.040
I messed up.

01:04:55.040 --> 01:05:00.000
Anyway, Sakura-chan, the other day,

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:01.000
So you came here.

01:05:01.000 --> 01:05:03.130
Are you going home?

01:05:03.130 --> 01:05:04.130
Yes.

01:05:04.130 --> 01:05:06.590
I see.

01:05:07.410 --> 01:05:09.300
So this is the aquarium.

01:05:09.300 --> 01:05:10.300
That's perfect.

01:05:10.300 --> 01:05:13.300
I'm going to make sure that the crow card is here.

01:05:13.300 --> 01:05:17.260
I'm going to film Sakura-chan's first date.

01:05:21.750 --> 01:05:22.750
Let's go!

01:05:23.610 --> 01:05:26.690
What a nice fish.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:32.620
It's impossible, isn't it?

01:05:32.620 --> 01:05:34.620
I don't think so.

01:05:34.620 --> 01:05:36.700
Oh, yeah.

01:05:36.700 --> 01:05:39.010
It's a little hot.

01:05:39.010 --> 01:05:41.010
Why can't you connect your hands?

01:05:41.010 --> 01:05:45.110
The children of the day.

01:05:45.110 --> 01:05:47.130
Young people get injured when they get involved with me.

01:05:49.580 --> 01:05:52.030
The two of you have moved.

01:05:52.030 --> 01:05:54.680
Good morning.

01:06:08.160 --> 01:06:10.300
Ah, it's because of the penguin accident...

01:06:11.300 --> 01:06:13.240
You don't know that there's a film, do you?

01:06:14.800 --> 01:06:15.800
While looking at beautiful fish...

01:06:18.600 --> 01:06:24.770
Did it change?

01:06:25.850 --> 01:06:29.290
I heard that we have to remove all the water from the tank and inspect it.

01:06:30.670 --> 01:06:32.470
So, what about Wotty?

01:06:32.470 --> 01:06:35.460
It's good that he's not in the fridge anymore.

01:06:35.460 --> 01:06:39.960
The penguins' food is stored in the fridge, so it was really cold.

01:06:39.960 --> 01:06:41.000
Eh?

01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:42.580
It's the same thing.

01:06:42.580 --> 01:06:45.170
This time, they're making shaved ice.

01:06:45.170 --> 01:06:48.250
It's delicious, this strawberry milk.

01:06:48.250 --> 01:06:48.920
Eh?

01:06:48.920 --> 01:06:51.440
Shaved ice?

01:06:51.440 --> 01:06:53.110
Ice?

01:06:53.110 --> 01:06:55.060
Then, give me two of those.

01:06:55.060 --> 01:06:56.730
Yes, yes.

01:06:56.730 --> 01:06:59.000
Yuki, don't you have to go to Oomori?

01:07:00.570 --> 01:07:05.830
What? A date with a Edo woman?

01:07:33.390 --> 01:07:34.290
Yuki!

01:08:12.060 --> 01:08:15.900
Are you okay?

01:08:15.900 --> 01:08:21.700
I saw you here.

01:08:21.700 --> 01:08:22.500
You saw me?

01:08:32.330 --> 01:08:34.010
Are you all right, Sakura-chan?

01:08:34.010 --> 01:08:35.120
Yes.

01:08:35.120 --> 01:08:38.450
The shaved ice has been ruined.

01:08:38.450 --> 01:08:40.320
What?

01:08:40.320 --> 01:08:42.840
Shaved ice? Shaved ice?

01:08:42.840 --> 01:08:45.920
Ice?

01:08:45.920 --> 01:08:56.590
Thank you for your hard work.

01:08:56.590 --> 01:08:57.940
Oh, thank you for your hard work.

01:09:01.240 --> 01:09:02.210
Next is the J-League.

01:09:02.210 --> 01:09:03.190
This is a new game...

01:09:03.190 --> 01:09:04.190
Shhh...

01:09:04.190 --> 01:09:08.230
Are you okay?

01:09:08.230 --> 01:09:09.280
Let me cry.

01:09:09.280 --> 01:09:25.710
You have the strongest magic.

01:09:25.710 --> 01:09:26.340
Hold it.

01:09:33.870 --> 01:09:34.480
That's right.

01:11:30.570 --> 01:11:34.070
It's about time for us to meet again.

01:12:02.330 --> 01:12:04.820
I've come up with a good idea!

01:12:04.820 --> 01:12:07.350
It's all thanks to you, Yukito-san!

01:12:07.350 --> 01:12:11.150
Wow, it's so fun!

01:12:15.040 --> 01:12:18.150
Oh, well, even Sakura has frozen to death.

01:12:18.150 --> 01:12:19.690
Ah, hehehe...

01:12:19.690 --> 01:12:21.970
Alright! I'm here too!

01:12:21.970 --> 01:12:24.580
Show me your guts next time, Sakura!

01:12:40.840 --> 01:12:41.460
Let's go.

01:14:03.360 --> 01:14:07.110
This is a video that Tomoyo took with his own camera.

01:14:07.110 --> 01:14:10.610
Oh, you're working hard on the camera.

01:14:10.610 --> 01:14:13.190
As expected of Sakura's exclusive cameraman.

01:14:13.190 --> 01:14:17.360
But what kind of person is he shooting? It's strange.

01:14:17.360 --> 01:14:26.200
Kero-chan has a hat with a water ball at the tip and sharp shoes.

01:14:26.200 --> 01:14:30.000
The fabric is made of a water-soluble, excellent material.

01:14:30.280 --> 01:14:36.680
Let's leave it at that for today. Even if I introduce you to a lot of people, you won't be able to enjoy the rest of the day.

01:14:36.680 --> 01:14:39.380
What a kind person you are, you know?

01:14:39.380 --> 01:14:43.470
See?

01:14:43.470 --> 01:14:55.130
I was thinking about it, but suddenly a big tree grew out of the basement, and the inside of the house became like a jungle. Why?

01:14:55.130 --> 01:14:59.030
Ah, is it because of the crow card I found in the basement?

01:15:04.480 --> 01:15:05.120
Let's do it together!

01:16:47.630 --> 01:16:51.430
Sakura, isn't it too early to say it's Sunday today?

01:16:51.430 --> 01:16:54.580
*cough*

01:17:03.390 --> 01:17:05.390
I don't get it if you don't understand, right?

01:17:05.390 --> 01:17:19.140
I'm glad the weather is nice.

01:17:19.140 --> 01:17:22.280
Good morning, Sakura-san.

01:17:22.280 --> 01:17:24.360
You're floating, Kaiju.

01:17:24.360 --> 01:17:29.270
I'll forgive you.

01:17:31.080 --> 01:17:34.450
Hmm... You sure are in a good mood, Sakura-san.

01:17:34.450 --> 01:17:47.440
You're the one who did all the work today, right?

01:17:47.440 --> 01:17:51.540
I drew it myself last week, did you forget?

01:18:00.480 --> 01:18:01.120
Piano!

01:18:01.120 --> 01:18:09.390
I got it, I'll take care of it.

01:18:09.390 --> 01:18:15.150
In exchange, next Sunday is the housework.

01:18:15.150 --> 01:18:16.710
You're going to do everything.

01:18:16.710 --> 01:18:24.480
Then, I'll do my part-time job.

01:18:24.480 --> 01:18:26.460
I'll do it.

01:18:26.460 --> 01:18:30.000
It's been raining lately.

01:18:30.060 --> 01:18:35.980
We've gathered so much, should we help each other out a bit?

01:18:35.980 --> 01:18:38.280
Daddy, you're having a meeting today, right?

01:18:38.280 --> 01:18:40.900
Don't worry, I'll do it!

01:18:40.900 --> 01:18:41.840
I'm sorry.

01:18:41.840 --> 01:18:43.240
Leave it to me!

01:18:43.240 --> 01:18:46.420
I'll leave this at the washing machine.

01:18:46.420 --> 01:18:47.770
I'm off!

01:18:48.820 --> 01:18:51.320
Have a nice day!

01:18:51.320 --> 01:18:54.410
I'm going out too.

01:18:54.410 --> 01:18:56.370
I'm off!

01:19:04.730 --> 01:19:09.290
I'm sorry. I completely forgot that today is the day of the festival.

01:19:09.290 --> 01:19:12.390
I can't help it.

01:19:12.390 --> 01:19:14.600
I'm really sorry.

01:19:14.600 --> 01:19:18.380
Don't worry too much and do your best for the festival.

01:19:18.380 --> 01:19:22.870
Yeah! Thank you! Then I'll go to school tomorrow!

01:19:22.870 --> 01:19:23.110
Tomorrow.

01:19:34.920 --> 01:19:39.700
On Monday, I'll bring you a letter of apology.

01:19:39.700 --> 01:19:57.970
You can't do things that no one else can do.

01:21:00.410 --> 01:21:02.670
There's nothing the strongest guardian beast can do!

01:21:02.670 --> 01:21:04.400
That's right!

01:21:04.400 --> 01:21:09.470
It's not over yet!

01:21:09.470 --> 01:21:11.610
I'll help you out a little more.

01:21:35.120 --> 01:21:37.240
Oh no, it's all over the place!

01:22:05.240 --> 01:22:08.450
Could you please check if there's a blue envelope on the table?

01:22:43.630 --> 01:22:47.910
Thank you!

01:22:47.910 --> 01:22:57.780
Sakura-chan, you're Tsukasa-san, aren't you?

01:22:57.780 --> 01:22:59.000
Are you her servant?

01:23:00.860 --> 01:23:01.860
I did it.

01:23:01.860 --> 01:23:02.860
You delivered it!

01:23:02.860 --> 01:23:03.850
You're great.

01:23:03.850 --> 01:23:08.440
Soup.

01:23:08.440 --> 01:23:11.540
Oh, it was a basketball game today.

01:23:11.540 --> 01:23:14.670
Please help me a little.

01:23:14.670 --> 01:23:17.670
Actually, Yukito-san doesn't go to any club.

01:23:17.670 --> 01:23:22.750
But I was asked to participate in the game.

01:23:22.750 --> 01:23:25.750
I'm smart and I can do anything.

01:23:25.750 --> 01:23:26.830
Annyeong!

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:32.900
Sakura-chan, is it lunch time yet?

01:23:32.900 --> 01:23:34.510
No, not yet.

01:23:34.510 --> 01:23:40.800
Why don't we eat together over there?

01:23:40.800 --> 01:23:46.650
Onii-chan...

01:23:46.650 --> 01:23:52.450
Thank you.

01:23:52.450 --> 01:23:53.960
Mori-san, Sara...

01:23:53.960 --> 01:24:00.000
This guy eats three times as much as I do.

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:03.180
You don't have to worry. It's my treat.

01:24:03.180 --> 01:24:05.600
Kero-chan is waiting at home.

01:24:05.600 --> 01:24:12.870
Huh? Kero-chan?

01:24:12.870 --> 01:24:15.330
Yes, she's healthy.

01:24:15.330 --> 01:24:18.050
It's hard to pay her, though.

01:24:42.160 --> 01:24:49.810
Thank you. I'll be getting ready for lunch soon.

01:25:01.690 --> 01:25:03.870
Ah, lunch time...

01:25:03.870 --> 01:25:05.870
Hey, this sound...

01:25:05.870 --> 01:25:08.960
Sound?

01:25:08.960 --> 01:25:15.170
It's a baby...

01:25:15.170 --> 01:25:16.170
It's like a tongue, isn't it?

01:25:16.170 --> 01:25:19.550
Yeah...

01:25:19.550 --> 01:25:21.570
Do you want to go out in broad daylight?

01:25:21.570 --> 01:25:30.000
There might be someone out there...

01:25:30.060 --> 01:25:31.250
Come on.

01:26:31.280 --> 01:26:41.740
However, now that I've written down my name, I feel like I've heard my owner say it for the first time!

01:26:41.740 --> 01:26:49.880
Certainly, I can't imagine that Wood would do something bad with a quiet card and the people around him.

01:27:30.510 --> 01:27:31.670
Who is it?

01:27:31.670 --> 01:27:33.080
You'll know when it comes out.

01:27:33.080 --> 01:27:34.000
Eh?

01:27:34.000 --> 01:27:39.060
If it's out, it'll become a rumor in the town hall!

01:27:39.060 --> 01:27:44.280
Kero-chan might be sold somewhere for a stuffed animal that can talk!

01:27:44.280 --> 01:27:45.650
I don't like that.

01:27:45.650 --> 01:27:48.890
Why are you being so rude?

01:27:48.890 --> 01:27:49.450
Ah!

01:27:49.450 --> 01:27:51.510
It's hot!

01:27:51.510 --> 01:27:55.830
For the time being, I'm...

01:27:56.760 --> 01:27:58.580
Kero-chan?

01:27:58.580 --> 01:28:00.000
I'm going to talk to the stuffed animal.

01:28:00.000 --> 01:28:01.000
Don't run away.

01:28:01.000 --> 01:28:02.440
That's unfair!

01:28:51.370 --> 01:28:53.110
I'm going to seal it up now!

01:29:32.040 --> 01:29:33.840
I think it's somewhere around here.

01:29:33.840 --> 01:29:35.720
In that room?

01:29:35.720 --> 01:29:37.080
I see.

01:29:37.080 --> 01:29:38.290
All right!

01:29:38.290 --> 01:29:39.760
Let's go get the card!

01:30:30.960 --> 01:30:33.110
Looks like she's calmer now.

01:30:33.110 --> 01:30:36.710
Looks like she's satisfied with the sunlight.

01:30:36.710 --> 01:30:45.310
As expected of Wood-san.

01:30:45.310 --> 01:30:46.850
Let's do it again.

01:30:46.850 --> 01:30:48.650
Don't let it get to you.

01:30:48.650 --> 01:30:50.640
I'll do it too, okay?

01:30:50.640 --> 01:30:54.410
Let's do it again.

01:30:54.410 --> 01:30:56.630
But what should we do with this?

01:30:56.630 --> 01:31:00.000
Even if we try to seal it, it'll go back to normal.

01:31:00.220 --> 01:31:04.850
Let's go to the card room and seal it completely!

01:31:04.850 --> 01:31:06.130
In the basement then?

01:31:06.130 --> 01:31:07.130
That's right!

01:31:07.130 --> 01:31:13.260
This sound is like a elephant walking...

01:31:13.260 --> 01:31:16.740
No, this house is a ghost house.

01:31:16.740 --> 01:31:18.740
Wood is still growing!

01:31:18.740 --> 01:31:20.720
It became quiet just now!

01:31:20.720 --> 01:31:23.140
I knew there was light outside!

01:31:23.140 --> 01:31:26.640
If Wood was to be hit by the sun...

01:31:26.640 --> 01:31:28.450
I'll destroy the house...

01:31:30.250 --> 01:31:34.070
It's the turn of Cardcaptor Sakura!

01:31:34.070 --> 01:31:52.890
Sakura-chan, I was going to take the "Turu o Mau no Maki".

01:31:52.890 --> 01:31:55.410
So, this bento is also prepared.

01:32:32.430 --> 01:32:35.740
I'll show you!

01:32:35.740 --> 01:32:39.390
What sound is that?

01:32:39.390 --> 01:32:40.600
Hmm...

01:32:40.600 --> 01:32:43.690
Then...

01:32:43.690 --> 01:32:44.720
I'm sorry?

01:32:44.720 --> 01:32:47.970
There's no water coming out of that card!

01:32:47.970 --> 01:32:49.900
Then, what about that one card?

01:32:49.900 --> 01:32:50.770
What?!

01:32:50.770 --> 01:32:53.590
There were two of them!

01:32:53.590 --> 01:32:55.410
That means...

01:33:05.980 --> 01:33:07.340
It's a rain card.

01:33:07.340 --> 01:33:11.560
Rain and Wood were influenced by each other and created a jungle like this.

01:33:11.560 --> 01:33:13.910
Sakura.

01:33:13.910 --> 01:33:15.130
Yes.

01:33:15.130 --> 01:33:16.880
It's finally here.

01:33:16.880 --> 01:33:20.780
Wood!

01:33:20.780 --> 01:33:24.920
This is it!

01:33:24.920 --> 01:33:26.390
It's wonderful...

01:33:26.390 --> 01:33:27.190
Sakura!

01:33:27.190 --> 01:33:28.070
It's night time!

01:33:28.070 --> 01:33:29.250
Ugh!

01:34:18.490 --> 01:34:19.300
This is...

01:36:01.790 --> 01:36:03.610
We're friends, aren't we?

01:36:03.610 --> 01:36:05.790
Oh, look at that!

01:36:05.790 --> 01:36:14.350
Wow! It's a rainbow!

01:36:14.350 --> 01:36:18.670
This is the first time I've ever used a card as my own.

01:36:18.670 --> 01:36:21.220
Yes, I knew it.

01:36:21.220 --> 01:36:24.040
If it's like that, I'll let you sleep for a while.

01:36:24.040 --> 01:36:26.040
Good night.

01:36:26.040 --> 01:36:27.340
I'm sorry about today.

01:36:27.340 --> 01:36:30.000
No, it's better than taking pictures in a forest park.

01:36:57.130 --> 01:36:58.580
I'm back!

01:37:10.520 --> 01:37:12.290
Thank you for your hard work today.

01:37:12.290 --> 01:37:14.290
Let's eat a cake later.

01:37:14.290 --> 01:37:17.510
If you don't write your name on the cake, you'll eat it.

01:37:45.200 --> 01:37:45.780
Let's show.

01:38:00.000 --> 01:38:05.030
It's been around for a long time

01:38:53.100 --> 01:38:56.610
It's time to leave it up to Kero-chan, who's going to be sending it to us!

01:38:56.610 --> 01:38:58.840
Come on, let's go right away!

01:39:00.320 --> 01:39:02.620
I'm wearing a battle costume today as well!

01:39:02.620 --> 01:39:05.120
Listen carefully to my explanation!

01:39:05.120 --> 01:39:09.660
The costume is made with the image of wings.

01:39:09.660 --> 01:39:12.860
Isn't it pretty cute with pop coloring?

01:39:12.860 --> 01:39:15.650
Rubber material is used as fabric.

01:39:15.650 --> 01:39:18.670
The shoes are high-cut shoes with a sense of stability.

01:39:18.670 --> 01:39:22.080
The gloves have a guard to protect your hands.

01:39:22.080 --> 01:39:26.360
Go, go, Kero-chan!

01:39:26.360 --> 01:39:29.440
The point is the cute wings on the head.

01:39:30.000 --> 01:39:35.180
I'm a type of drunkard!

01:39:35.180 --> 01:39:37.180
It's almost time for the end.

01:39:37.180 --> 01:39:39.180
How is it? Are you used to this corner?

01:39:39.180 --> 01:39:43.180
In the future, there are still many more things to come out, so don't worry about it!

01:39:43.180 --> 01:39:57.060
I wonder if I should go with Twin Bell and Chiharu-chan.

01:39:57.060 --> 01:40:00.000
But there is a strange voice in that store.

01:40:00.190 --> 01:40:01.190
I heard there's a rumor.

01:40:01.190 --> 01:40:02.270
The rumor is...

01:40:02.270 --> 01:40:03.200
Sakura!

01:40:03.200 --> 01:40:06.250
Sakura and the panda have a cute shop!

01:40:06.250 --> 01:40:07.250
Next time, with Sakura...

01:40:07.250 --> 01:40:08.310
Eriiis!

01:40:08.310 --> 01:40:09.360
Eriiis!

01:40:09.360 --> 01:40:10.360
Eriiis!

01:40:10.360 --> 01:40:11.340
Eriiis!
